              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Y
                  %mo ↪
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Y\hookrightarrow X
            has a left adjoint, which sends
            %math#mathml_0f5e1be87694ca9e1bbc9098abd259afbfc74b8a_106.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
